      "content": "Self-sacrifice cannot erase the person who once mattered, and their healing will eventually rely on you remaining as a living witness to their shared history rather than leaving them alone. By staying, you inadvertently give them the only strength they have left to grieve without letting their pain define your entire existence forever. You do not serve as the sole anchor for their sorrow; instead, your presence holds the story of love alive in a way no actions could ever truly replicate.",
